<slide xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0"><style><fill><fillColor color="rgb(250,245,240)"/></fill></style><data><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="34" width="864" height="52"><content textType="body" fontSize="30" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>第二步 · 设定假设：只留相互牵制</p></content></shape><img src="FILE_TOKEN_SPRINGS" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="104" width="440" height="251"/><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="362" width="440" height="56"><content textType="body" fontSize="18" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(115,95,95)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35"><p>古诺的原例：两位业主各有一眼矿泉，成本可以忽略。插图为课堂示意。</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="104" width="36" height="34"><content textType="body" fontSize="22" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>1</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="558" topLeftY="100" width="354" height="56"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>两家厂商，出售同一种矿泉水</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="164" width="36" height="34"><content textType="body" fontSize="22" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>2</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="558" topLeftY="160" width="354" height="56"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>每家决定自己的产量，价格由市场决定</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="224" width="36" height="34"><content textType="body" fontSize="22" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>3</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="558" topLeftY="220" width="354" height="56"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>每家把对手的产量当作给定不变</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="284" width="36" height="34"><content textType="body" fontSize="22" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>4</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="558" topLeftY="280" width="354" height="56"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>需求是线性的：<formula><latex><![CDATA[p=a-bQ]]></latex></formula></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="344" width="36" height="34"><content textType="body" fontSize="22" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(210,90,86)" bold="true" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="top" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35" wrap="false"><p>5</p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="558" topLeftY="340" width="354" height="56"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25"><p>每家的边际成本同为 <formula><latex><![CDATA[c]]></latex></formula></p></content></shape><shape type="text" topLeftX="48" topLeftY="428" width="864" height="60"><content textType="body" fontSize="20" fontFamily="微软雅黑" color="rgb(46,32,38)" textAlign="left" verticalAlign="middle" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3"><p>知识创造的要点：假设不求“符合现实”，而是判断——哪些细节与“相互牵制”无关，可以大胆删掉。</p></content></shape></data><note><content textType="body" fontSize="14"><p><!-- citation: [1] --></p><p>古诺的原例是矿泉水：两位业主各有一眼泉，水是同一种，取水成本几乎为零。</p><p>请注意这五条假设各自删掉了什么：产品差异、定价行为、策略互动、需求形状和成本差异。</p><p>可以问学生：这五条里，哪一条是“相互牵制”真正需要的？答案是第三条——把对手的产量当作给定。</p></content></note></slide>
